{"id":"P-COMPASS-620","uuid":"94d695e6-a10e-4825-8113-480371527f40","icon":"Conversation","color":"#4cb782","name":"CSR Chat - Live Sales App","summary":"Deliver a production-ready, synthetic Compass CSR Chat tenant for secure, customer-neutral sales demonstrations through verified access, realistic benefits data, and sanitized content.","description":"## Executive Summary

This project will make Compass CSR Chat demonstrable to prospective customers through a dedicated Stellarus tenant that uses no real customer or member data. It will deliver a versioned, contract-faithful synthetic benefits catalog, a supported authentication and role-mapping flow for internal presenters, and a sanitized tenant-neutral bundle of prompts, rules, and scripts. Together, these capabilities will enable the new UI to provide credible benefits inquiries and structured responses while clearly identifying the experience as synthetic.

Release readiness depends on proving that at least 20 approved benefits scenarios are grounded in the synthetic dataset, authorized users can reliably access the correct tenant and persona, and all customer-specific content has been removed without degrading supported answer behavior. The release will enforce strict safeguards against cross-tenant access, customer-data leakage, and unsupported claims, while validating failure handling, session resets, accessibility, and regression boundaries for the existing Compass CSR Chat platform.","url":"https://linear.app/stellarus/project/csr-chat-live-sales-app-382c90a423c2","resourceCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-09-22T16:57:15.104Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-13T21:07:53.306Z","startedAt":"2026-09-23T22:17:18.084Z","completedAt":null,"canceledAt":null,"startDate":"2026-09-23","startDateResolution":null,"targetDate":"2026-09-30","targetDateResolution":null,"priority":{"value":1,"name":"Urgent"},"labels":["Atlas Services","CSR Chat","Compass"],"initiatives":[{"id":"4d1f58e6-9b68-471e-9a8a-9072ed761f82","name":"CSR Chat Campaign & Rapid Deployment"},{"id":"3898d82c-99f8-4ad7-a0b4-43a4d9b651e1","name":"Atlas Domain Services MVP"}],"lead":{"id":"ab5e858e-c973-4b8a-b8b4-1522ec7e80ff","name":"Jason Jackson"},"leadTeam":{"id":"23265ca4-2cf9-43e1-a28d-a54250d2aa60","name":"Compass","key":"COMPASS"},"status":{"id":"57df9e80-2ef4-4072-b0f6-f12ffc2aa073","name":"Build & Integrate","type":"started"},"teams":[{"id":"23265ca4-2cf9-43e1-a28d-a54250d2aa60","name":"Compass","key":"COMPASS"},{"id":"b374b4d6-94e6-4d99-a1e3-c81056bd40f7","name":"Atlas Services","key":"ATS"},{"id":"f34ae3ef-40ef-4813-b2a1-01791b15871c","name":"Product","key":"PRODUCT"},{"id":"f4f78062-3194-487b-924e-3c06d906cc24","name":"AI and Analytics","key":"AIA"},{"id":"16802391-2936-4847-afd3-fbf0f00ac0e9","name":"Engineering","key":"ENG"}],"slackChannelId":"C0C3STKUPQC","milestones":[],"resources":[{"type":"document","id":"c3714d95-6770-414d-a6f1-48954cc2cc18","title":"CSR Chat - 