{"id":"P-COMPASS-643","uuid":"61604014-a194-4896-98f8-ad58a02dce5b","icon":"FloppyDisk","color":"#4cb782","name":"CSR Chat Golden Dataset Quality Validation MVP","summary":"Establish a repeatable, human-approved CSR Chat quality validation workflow using customer-specific golden datasets, traceable evaluations, and customer-facing confidence reports.","description":"This MVP establishes an internal Golden Dataset Quality Workspace for Data Science and Product to validate customer-specific CSR Chat quality before pilots and product launches. It replaces fragmented spreadsheets and review artifacts with a repeatable workflow spanning customer onboarding, reusable platform questions, customer-specific canonical answers, agent-response collection, LLM-assisted critique, human adjudication, and Product approval. Versioned datasets and evaluation runs preserve traceability, distinguish platform-owned assets from isolated customer-owned data, and produce an executive confidence report and detailed evidence export for each approved run.

The MVP focuses on single-turn CSR Chat evaluation, allowing manual imports and execution where needed while preserving an information model that can support future chat and voice experiences. Data Science retains final case-level judgment, Product owns dataset approval and documented exceptions, and accepted exceptions remain failed cases in quality scoring. Success targets include review-ready onboarding within two business days by the third onboarding, complete applicability classification and approved-case evidence, and at least 85% agreement between LLM recommendations and human decisions across the first three approved datasets. Customer self-service, multi-turn evaluation, automated regression orchestration, and production monitoring remain outside scope.","url":"https://linear.app/stellarus/project/csr-chat-golden-dataset-quality-validation-mvp-d4ae00373c1e","resourceCount":2,"createdAt":"2026-10-05T18:59:48.286Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-13T21:50:22.055Z","startedAt":"2026-10-13T21:50:22.054Z","completedAt":null,"canceledAt":null,"startDate":"2026-10-13","startDateResolution":null,"targetDate":"2026-11-06","targetDateResolution":null,"priority":{"value":2,"name":"High"},"labels":["Platform","Compass"],"initiatives":[{"id":"0dde1297-1afa-4308-88c1-8bc538f4b508","name":"Compass - Conversational AI"}],"lead":{"id":"ab5e858e-c973-4b8a-b8b4-1522ec7e80ff","name":"Jason Jackson"},"leadTeam":{"id":"23265ca4-2cf9-43e1-a28d-a54250d2aa60","name":"Compass","key":"COMPASS"},"status":{"id":"57df9e80-2ef4-4072-b0f6-f12ffc2aa073","name":"Build & Integrate","type":"started"},"teams":[{"id":"23265ca4-2cf9-43e1-a28d-a54250d2aa60","name":"Compass","key":"COMPASS"},{"id":"f34ae3ef-40ef-4813-b2a1-01791b15871c","name":"Product","key":"PRODUCT"},{"id":"f4f78062-3194-487b-924e-3c06d906cc24","name":"AI and Analytics","key":"AIA"}],"milestones":[{"id":"9b2130eb-38a2-40b6-8062-172ad0934f38","name":"MVP","description":"# 1. Customer and Experience Onboarding

